<title>UK: Oerlikon-Buehrle sets 150 mln Sfr convertible.</title>
<headline>Oerlikon-Buehrle sets 150 mln Sfr convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse, UBS and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OERLIKON-BUEHRLE HOLDING AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE  CONVERTIBLE    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> EOS	   15.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES	EACH SWISS FANC 5 (K) BOND IS CONVERTIBLE INTO</p>
<p>		34 OERLIKON-BUEHRLE REGISTERED SHARES AT A</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PRICE OF 146 SFR, PLUS A CASH PAYMENT OF</p>
<p>		36 SFR.</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE OF 124.50 SFR.</p>
<p>	  THE CONVERSION PREMIUM IS 17.27 PCT. THE BONDSMAY</p>
<p>	  BE CONVERTED AT ANY TIME IN THE LIFE OF THE ISSUE.</p>
<p> LISTING     EBS	 DENOMS (K) 5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
